# Fetched from a core release and checked against its manifest: the fake
# controller, and the contract set the fixture tests resolve against.
/.core/
/contract/**
!/contract/**/
# The two members the package compiles from are tracked, so a clone and the Hex
# package compile without a release; the core's conformance gate holds them equal.
!/contract/flz_transport/errors.json
!/contract/protobufs/runner_commands.proto
# Copied from a core release by `scripts/fetch-core.sh`; a Hex release carries it.
/checksum-Elixir.Flezha.SDK.Native.exs
/native/flz_sdk_nif/Cargo.lock
/tmp/
